            /></item>

        <!-- Version 1.3.0 - Flower UI Redesign (Build 6) -->
        <item>
            <title>Version 1.3.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 15 Jul 2026 08:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>6</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <style>
                    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; }
                    h2 { color: #7C3AED; }
                    ul { padding-left: 20px; }
                    li { margin: 8px 0; }
                </style>
                <h2>WizWrite 1.3.0 — A whole new look</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Complete redesign</strong> — WizWrite's new flower design language across the entire app</li>
                    <li><strong>New dictation pill</strong> with a cancel button, live-transcript view, and clearer states</li>
                    <li><strong>Private by design</strong> — transcription now happens entirely on your Mac; audio never leaves the device. Your first dictation will ask you to download a transcription model (one-time)</li>
                    <li><strong>Redesigned Integrations</strong> — automations and saved destinations with payload transparency</li>
                    <li><strong>New Home screen</strong>, refreshed Sessions, Files, AI Actions, and Team</li>
                    <li><strong>Audio import</strong> — drop in an audio file for an on-device transcript + AI actions</li>
                    <li><strong>Failed transcriptions keep your audio</strong> with a one-click retry</li>
                    <li><strong>Fixed</strong> a silent no-op in the Apply-on-Dictate dropdowns</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/wizwrite/wizwrite-releases/releases/download/v1.3.0/WizWrite-1.3.0.dmg"
                sparkle:edSignature="LQc+f7eyaWF/5eiz9HaIdgm0SqAJJ4tx0in9FLyY0D6jjXZ1xbQA3sB1EwzZ+zGDnYrc9kva2dNnAlUCR9msDw=="
                length="16883431"
                type="application/octet-stream"
            />
        </item>

